# Launchway edge proxy: bootstrap configuration.
#
# Only the global options live here. The Launchway API renders the site blocks
# from its routes and loads the complete configuration through the admin API.
# Caddy runs with --resume, so it keeps the last loaded configuration across
# restarts and reads this file only when nothing has been loaded yet.
#
# The admin API listens on a unix socket in the caddy-admin volume, which only
# the caddy and launchway containers mount. It has no authentication, so it must
# never listen on a TCP port: app containers share the launchway-proxy network.
{
	admin unix//run/caddy-admin/admin.sock|0222
	email {$LAUNCHWAY_ACME_EMAIL}
	cert_issuer acme
}
